## Feature 4: Vendor Fulfillment Dashboard (Alden)
### User Story
As a kitchen staff member,
I want to see incoming group orders organised by item type,
So that I can prepare orders efficiently without confusion.

#### Acceptance Criteria
- Given there are incoming orders, when I open the dashboard, then I can see all orders grouped by item type (e.g. drinks, mains, sides)
- Given a new order comes in, when it is submitted by a customer, then it appears on the dashboard under the correct item type
- Given multiple orders exist, when I view the dashboard, then each item type is clearly separated and labelled

